:[{"context_after":"，商以小黄门曹节用事于中，遣子冀与交友，而宦官忌其宠，反...","context_before":"...刚决不下昭帝，但《范史》发明不出，故后世无称焉。顺帝时，","source_end_index":138,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8489f931-69e5-4d51-81f5-e3d481357e9b","source_start_index":130,"source_text":"梁商为大将军辅政"}],"path":"随笔/卷三/汉昭顺二帝","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"5夏，四月，甲子，太尉施延免。戊寅，以執金吾梁商爲大將軍，故太尉龐參爲太尉。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月初五甲子日，太尉施延被免职。四月十九日戊寅，任命执金吾梁商为大将军，前太尉庞参为太尉。","content_jianti_auto":"5夏，四月，甲子，太尉施延免。戊寅，以执金吾梁商为大将军，故太尉庞参为太尉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4356,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9695dd33-db0e-11ef-91e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9695dd3a-db0e-11ef-a50f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"衞青","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞青","start_index":176,"tongjian_id":"9695dd3b-db0e-11ef-be38-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9695dd3c-db0e-11ef-abdf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":172,"tongjian_id":"9695dd3d-db0e-11ef-b803-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"杜佑曰：後漢策拜諸王侯、三公之儀：百官會，位定，謁者引光祿勳前，謁者引當拜者前，伏殿下。光祿前一拜，舉手曰：「制詔，其以某爲某。」讀策書畢，拜者稱臣，再拜。尚書郞以璽印綬付侍御史，前面立受印璽綬，當受策者再拜頓首，三贊。謁者曰：「某王臣某新封，某公某初除，謝。」中謁者報，「謹謝。」贊者立曰：「皇帝爲公興。」重坐。受策者拜謝，起，就位。禮畢。自漢以來惟衞青以有功卽軍中拜大將軍，未聞有就第卽拜者也，況以此異數加之后父乎！","note_content_jianti_auto":"杜佑曰：后汉策拜诸王侯、三公之仪：百官会，位定，谒者引光禄勋前，谒者引当拜者前，伏殿下。光禄前一拜，举手曰：「制诏，其以某为某。」读策书毕，拜者称臣，再拜。尚书郞以玺印绶付侍御史，前面立受印玺绶，当受策者再拜顿首，三赞。谒者曰：「某王臣某新封，某公某初除，谢。」中谒者报，「谨谢。」赞者立曰：「皇帝为公兴。」重坐。受策者拜谢，起，就位。礼毕。自汉以来惟衞青以有功即军中拜大将军，未闻有就第即拜者也，况以此异数加之后父乎！","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"9695dd39-db0e-11ef-b510-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"少，詩沼翻。好，呼到翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"少，诗沼翻。好，呼到翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"9695dd3e-db0e-11ef-b831-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"巨","people_name_jianti_auto":"巨","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9695dd40-db0e-11ef-a5eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"覽","people_name_jianti_auto":"览","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9695dd41-db0e-11ef-a5b5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"巨，姓；覽，名。","note_content_jianti_auto":"巨，姓；览，名。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"9695dd3f-db0e-11ef-833d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"太常","official_note":"太常掌管宗庙礼仪，此处表示皇帝派遣太常桓焉前往商府宣读任命诏书，体现对商的重用。","official_rank":"九卿之一，正三品","source_snippet":"帝使太常桓焉奉策就第卽拜","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c1f91d1-2539-474b-a62c-351e287ec762"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"掾屬","official_note":"掾属是汉代地方长官的属吏，此处表示商任命汉阳巨览和上党陈龟为他的属官，显示其招揽人才。","official_rank":"低级属官","source_snippet":"辟漢陽巨覽、上黨陳龜爲掾屬","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"fc1a44fb-1656-4171-8efc-c7fd32734420"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"從事中郞","official_note":"从事中郎是汉代将军或州郡长官的属官，负责参谋军事，此处表示商任命李固为从事中郎，可能涉及军事事务。","official_rank":"中级军官","source_snippet":"李固爲從事中郞","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"f6c61f2d-f73a-4de6-b41c-b0dcd6706084"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"長史","official_note":"长史是汉代公府或将军府的高级属官，掌管府内事务