，愚者覩怪讳名。』天道无亲，可为祗畏。诚令王纲一整，道行忠立，明公踵伯成之高，全不朽之誉，岂与此外戚凡辈耽荣好位者同日而论哉！」商不能用。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4358,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9695dd4d-db0e-11ef-9905-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6秋，閏八月，丁亥朔，日有食之。","content_fanyi":"秋季，闰八月初一丁亥日，发生了日食。","content_jianti_auto":"6秋，闰八月，丁亥朔，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4359,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9698278b-db0e-11ef-beb9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雲中郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"云中郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9698278e-db0e-11ef-b3a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沙南縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"沙南县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9698278f-db0e-11ef-9e19-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蘭池城","place_name_jianti_auto":"兰池城","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"96982790-db0e-11ef-9e5d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"續漢志：雲中郡沙南縣有蘭池城。","note_content_jianti_auto":"续汉志：云中郡沙南县有兰池城。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"9698278d-db0e-11ef-8f42-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"度遼將軍","official_note":"度遼將軍是漢代設置的軍事官職，主要負責邊疆防禦和征討任務，尤其在北方邊境對抗匈奴、烏桓等民族。在《資治通鑑》此段中，度遼將軍耿曄被派遣追擊入侵雲中的烏桓，顯示其在軍事行動中的指揮角色。此信息